odecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thank you for trusting in our efficiency and quality. See you in the next galaxy!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587480/extras/c36d38a8c444362babc53d8335204fa3.avif?t=1752184423\" data-has-big width=800 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587480/extras/3d520cec2685928d4f52791f2f36e6e6.avif?t=1752184423\" width=800 height=125 /></span></p>",
